{"id":1385,"name":"Kagi Hime Monogatari: Eikyuu Alice Rondo","slug":"kagi_hime_monogatari_eikyuu_alice_rondo","synopsis":"Kirihara Aruto loves the stories of Alice, so much so that he begins to write one. One night while writing, he sees a girl out his window who he thinks is Alice. He follows her, and discovers that she is called a Seeker of Alice, and with the powers granted to her she fights other Seekers of Alice to take their eternal story, in order to find the part that belongs to the Eternal Alice. \n\nThroughout Aruto's adventures with Arisugawa Arisu, his little sister Kirihara Kiraha and their various friends they discover more about the land of Alice, about the novels, the man who wrote them, and their own powers.","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2006,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:00","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 03:49:27","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":577},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":577},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":533},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":3985},{"site":"ANN","externalId":6027},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":2018}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2761,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/MnYEfkZOqVuewLkGWLsf1pQsQsue7iv0tViwtYVA.jpg"},{"id":2762,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/5LHqXhsQuq7yvEGRIkRaiclFwgTEDc6iTw7I9Y1p.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":237,"name":"Trinet Entertainment","slug":"trinet_entertainment"},{"id":238,"name":"Picture Magic","slug":"picture_magic"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":2574,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":2574,"title":"Little Primrose","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":2894,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":1635,"basename":"KagiHimeMonogatari-OP1.webm","filename":"KagiHimeMonogatari-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/KagiHimeMonogatari-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":26081258,"resolution":476,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","sourc